{"version":1,"content":"<p>蘋果已經正式將首款摺疊屏手機iPhone Duo加入自助維修計劃，用户和第三方維修人員現在可以通過蘋果官方自助維修商店購買原裝零部件及維修工具。此次開放的零件涵蓋內外屏幕、電池、攝像頭、機身外殼和主板等主要組件，也意味着iPhone Duo用户獲得了官方提供的自行維修渠道。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1586876.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T06:06:32.080347+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":142,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T05:55:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-18T05:59:50.078754+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T05:59:50.078754+00:00","content_hash":"084f5ca5f7629e472fa514c318718d198e6435a53962a97334c76db217d3ef45","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}